      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What is the expected Return on Ad Spend (ROAS) for special education marketing?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Because a single child enrollment typically involves long-term multi-month therapy packages (speech, ABA, OT, or special school tuition), our client centres achieve 7x to 12x Return on Ad Spend (ROAS) based on annual student lifetime value."
